Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to hit the\NIndo-Pakistani border.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's time to say goodbye to India.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I had mixed feelings\Nabout the country at first, but now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually kinda miss\Nthe hustle and bustle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of Calcutta and frenetic\Nchaos of the Ganges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be coming back\Nagain one of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe it to Avdol to\Ngive him a proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.27,0:00:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The road's getting narrower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're driving so slow,\Nidiot! Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pass the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.67,0:01:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This four-wheel drive is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that crazy maneuver of yours\Nmight have just damaged that poor car.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.39,0:01:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying we don't need\Nany more trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wanted because of\Nwhat happened in Varanasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.91,0:01:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get across\Nthe border in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop I told you a\Ncrash could be disastrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that just look who's standing there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.77,0:01:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.23,0:01:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No see guys got room for one more
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:03:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star and go.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.14,0:03:34.77,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,642)\pos(192,815)}Episode 13: Wheel of Fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on, I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll be doing girl\Nthings like wearing a bra
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and doing my nails to get\Nthe attention of boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd look pathetic wandering around\Nthe world when I'm that age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.49,0:03:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the only chance I have to be\Nfree and see the world. Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I feel bad for lying about\Ngoing to see my dad in Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well let's just forget about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey it's that car we passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him pass. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let you pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.23,0:04:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably angry about your maneuver\Nand these are the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did you get a look at\Nthe driver's face. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The windows were covered in thick dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither could. I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be very careful. Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he wants me to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the fools realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how shitty that piece of junk is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should've stayed behind\Nme the first place, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?! No use! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.85,0:05:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it went for star\Nplatinum's power we would
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have been crushed beneath that like a tin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can He's gone where\Ndid that blasted car go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks like it just kept\Ngoing i think the driver
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could have been one of the\Nstand users then again it could
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have just been some sick bastard\NOf course he's one of dio's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lackeys we were almost road\Nkilled for god's sake Then why
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't he simply attack us with\Nhis stand when he had the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we've got to keep\Nheading to Pakistan. Be on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone comes after us again,\Nwe'll make them eat our dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do about that truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum left it a wreck\Nand won't be going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We pretend we never saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A roadside T-Stand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brake would do us some\Ngood If we take our time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we may avoid running\Ninto that crazy driver
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:06:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh sugar cane juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.37,0:07:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care for a glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.11,0:07:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That car's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the owner of that\Ncar parked over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, spill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm not sure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, sir, I\Ndidn't notice it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our driver isn't just going\Nto come out and announce it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's messing with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, then I guess this leaves us with\Nonly one option. Right, Jotaro? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, poor innocent bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just beat them all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:08:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro! This is crazy!\NMr. Joestar! Not you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty suspicious mug you got\Nthere. Was it you? Huh? Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That slippery bastard just\Nplayed the lot of us didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anyone see his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could be just some madman with a\Ncar or he could be trying to kill Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah we need to take care of this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't rest until I catch\Nhim and get to the bottom of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention we owe him payback for\Nthe truck that almost hit us earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:08:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That car can really get up and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the map, we should be running\Nparallel with train tracks or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll catch up soon anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna nail him once\Nwe round this curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dead end! That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell'd he go? He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just drive off the cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could\Ncross this suspension bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.55,0:09:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He keeps pushing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did he get behind us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much horsepower is that\Npiece of junk running with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like fighting a tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our only chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get out of the car until\Nthe rest of us are clear first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to hold down the brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S-sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hyraband Green!
