Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be torn to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, with all due respect,\NI am aware of my own abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You used the car's winch\Ninstead of just brute strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like sumo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially deadlocks at\Nthe edge of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exciting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm a fan of sumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in sumo, it's against the\Nrules to punch your opponent.
