Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing here suggests\Nto use the stand attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say he's just\Nsome weirdo with an axe to grind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.73,0:11:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, either way, he's\Na goner after that fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess what goes around comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I still wonder,\Nhow did it get behind us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.87,0:12:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like watching a\Nmagician or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.25,0:12:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, little girl,\Nit's not strange at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming through the AM-FM!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to do that because\Nit's my stand, Joestar! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows my name, so that confirms it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an enemy stand user. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he really be sending a\Nsignal from the car down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see the wreck down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.87,0:12:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No that old jalopy could\Nvery well be a stand
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you remember the boat\Nstand this may be a repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the wheel of fortune my\Nstand will lead you to your maker!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wheel of fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the an earthquake I've got a\Nbad feeling everybody get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.59,0:12:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No stay back Don't go anywhere near it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't be below us
