Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It burrowed up to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I think it's pretty obvious\Nthat car is actually a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the stand's\Nuser is inside the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what is it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like it's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's heading straight for us!
