Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's a duel you want,\NI'm happy to oblige.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fight it yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not until we know what\Nthat Stan's power is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:13:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.29,0:14:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.35,0:14:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did he shoot at\Nme, and how the hell did he...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even know what hits you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll soon find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment you croak, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.95,0:14:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro! Hold her up! Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wounds aren't deep,\Nbut they sting like hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the car threw something at us,\Nbut there's nothing inside our wounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.37,0:14:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the hell he's hurling\Nat us, but he's got damn good aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pulverize your\Nlegs so you can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then run you over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run between the boulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.11,0:14:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop running away, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:14:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you, roaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's digging his way through!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're no match for him in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's acting like some stupid muscle\Nhead who got caught off in traffic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and flew into a bit of road rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay, so I ran away from home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a good-for-nothing\Ndrifter that nobody loves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.69,0:15:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have time to say all that crap,\Nyou can run away, you damn little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you so much, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ha, ha, ha, go ahead and climb,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no path left for you to take,\Nno way to escape, no way to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.07,0:15:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and last but certainly\Nnot least, no future,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because this wheel of\Nfortune is going to grind you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.41,0:16:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into mid-speed and splatter\Nyou all over these boulders,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.43,0:16:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll paint this mountain\Nred with your guts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh no, it's climbing up The cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything this car can't do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the time to fight him's now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of you stay back. He's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once he climbs up here, the\Ncar's underside will be bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll see just how\Nstrong this thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once its underside's exposed,\Nwe may be able to attack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pretty fast there,\NJojo-Roo, but not too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body's reeking, you\Nhaven't even noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:17:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I\Nguess I did smell gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.55,0:17:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our bodies smell like a gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it was shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was shooting small\Namounts of it at height.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he wasn't trying to wound us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.37,0:17:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was dousing our bodies with gasoline!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.15,0:17:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're covered in this stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you finally caught\Non, but it's too late now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all you need is a little jolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.19,0:17:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro! Mr. Joestar! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.03,0:17:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're soaking with gasoline, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.81,0:17:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:17:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your valiant hero finally bit the dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who exactly would\Nreplace me, Chotaro Cujo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you thought\Nit'd be you, you roadhog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.11,0:18:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You burrowed into the\Nground with star platinum,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the only thing that\Nburned up was your jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little parting wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you said earlier\Nabout paths was dead wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, in life, you have\Nto forge your own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can do it for you, so\NI'll offer you some guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but first you have to\Ngo through a little pain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, you just paved your own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats on being a fast learner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here ends the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an odd guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His arms are the size of boulders\Nand yet everything else is so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just sinners for the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.01,0:20:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you look at that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the stand was disguising\Nsuch a small car that entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinda reminds me of a fluffy little sheep\Nthat just had all of its wool shorn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.03,0:20:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic hunk of junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.24,Note,Note,0,0,0,,{\fs(70)}I am a priest in training. \NPlease do not disturb my meditation by undoing my restraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's take his\Ncar across the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.01,0:20:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only fair since he smashed ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.31,0:20:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pretty beat up, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.81,0:20:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it'll last that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on the next flight to Hong\NKong once we find an airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.73,0:20:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand that you're\Nin the way, you little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might not make it that far.
