Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My seven assassins have all\Nbeen defeated, and so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they be crushed\Nlike that? The shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot bear to face Lordeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.61,0:21:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse Jotaro and his wretched grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Inyava, shall be your\Nnext and final opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fight with my very own\Nstand, the stand of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.

